<title>USA: Morgan County, Ala., allows bingo.</title>
<headline>Morgan County, Ala., allows bingo.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ala. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in Morgan County, Alabama approved a measure allowing for-profit bingo in the county, an official in the office of the county probate judge said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Voters approved the for-profit bingo by a vote of 22,309 to 12,753, the clerk said.</p>
<p>--JAne Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
